@@ -9227,3 +9227,4 @@ Did NOT modify research-roadmap.yaml or scripts/research_conductor.py. Did NOT p
 - 2026-06-17: Archive .398 -> activate .399; KEEP the hardened green-gate + poison-test quarantine. Assert research-complete.yaml + ops/exclusion_manifest.yaml parse under yaml.safe_load; run the smart-subset pre-test gate green; RECORD the TRUE .398 close-state truthfully (per exp4312 capstone): verifier_thesis_state=efficiency_parity_hardened; EFFICIENCY-PARITY HARDENED (exp4303 efficiency_pareto_holds=true, energy 0.8 vs judge 0.5, cost_ratio 1.03e-08, accuracy_delta_ci95 [0.1,0.5] excl 0, verifier_is_oracle=false -- the operator's §5 win condition, MET); SELF-LEARNING HELPS powered (exp4306 online_adaptation_helps=true, +0.529, CI95 [0.408,0.651] excl 0); IN-GENERATION moat OPEN/UNDERPOWERED-POSITIVE (exp4304 diffusiongemma_guidance_moat=false, carnot_minus_best_control_delta +0.133, CI95 [-0.067,0.367] incl 0, controls_differentiated=true, scorer_leak_recheck_passed=true -- a clean harness needing a stronger method + more power); CROSS-DOMAIN moat OPEN/UNDERPOWERED-POSITIVE (exp4305 cross_domain_selection_holds=false, cross_domain_delta +0.231, CI95 [-0.115,0.538] incl 0, label_ablation_robust=true, GAP-CROSS-DOMAIN-FAMILY-INVARIANT-SELECTION-4305 logged); ARC stalled at 22 on a HARNESS failure (exp4307 FLAGGED GATE_PASSED_WITHOUT_DATA: frontier adapter unavailable, exploration_actions_used=0 -- NOT a science failure); INFRA shipped (exp4308 DEGENERATE_CONTROLS check + robust aggregate-available helper); paper_ready=True (FoVer 0.9131, G1-G4 pass). Frame .399 as close-the-two-open-moats (cross-domain + in-generation) + deploy-efficiency-cascade + unstall-ARC. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success: archived_v398_v399_active_efficiency_hardened_True_self_learning_helps_True_two_moats_open_arc_harness_stall_22; results/experiment_4313_archive_v398_activate_v399.json
 - 2026-06-17: PHASE A1 (CLOSE THE CROSS-DOMAIN SELECTION MOAT; rebuild the underpowered exp4305) -- a domain router + per-domain set-encoder that generalizes selection to a HELD-OUT DOMAIN, rebuilt with the flagged SOTA + more power. .398 (exp4305) reported a POSITIVE point estimate (cross_domain_delta +0.231) but CI95 [-0.115,0.538] INCLUDED 0 (underpowered, NOT refuted); label_ablation_robust=true (no domain-label leak); GAP-CROSS-DOMAIN-FAMILY-INVARIANT-SELECTION-4305 logged. The .398 SOTA ingestion (exp4309) + the .399 sweep flagged the precise upgrades: (1) replace the nearest-centroid router with an IR3DE LINEAR domain-expert router (ridge regression over normalized selector features, leave-one-domain-out; arXiv:2606.06098); (2) add CASCAL GENERATED-DATA synthetic-task pretraining (train-only synthetic selector tasks from domain descriptions, query-only routers, no target labels; arXiv:2601.09692) for more router training signal; (3) add ContextPRM domain-AGNOSTIC step-COHERENCE features (verify the logical connection, not the domain fact; arXiv:2509.24460) as the domain-invariant discriminator; (4) MORE held-out tasks (>=~24) for power. Keep the LABEL-ABLATION anti-leak arm + the non-degenerate guards (vote@1>0.05, oracle<1.0, delta<0.95) so the adversarial_verify DEGENERATE_SEPARATION check does not fire. Domains: ARC families + ARC-GEN generators (reuse exp4291's non-degenerate pool) + FoVer-step/math (NOT code -- exp4319 owns code-execution). Emit cross_domain_selection_holds BARE bool := (held-out-domain delta>0 AND CI95-excl-0 AND non-degenerate guards AND label_ablation_robust). verifier_is_oracle=false. A held-out-domain win escapes the math/ARC domain bound (the strongest selection result yet); a powered collapse is a genuine, decision-grade scope boundary. HARD-CAP to the window; an honest partial (>=3 domains, >=1 held-out, >=~16 held-out tasks) is fine. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: powered_collapse_cross_domain_domain_bound; results/experiment_4314_cross_domain_selector_ir3de_cascal.json
 - 2026-06-17: PHASE B1 (CLOSE THE IN-GENERATION MOAT; rebuild the underpowered exp4304 w/ a stronger architecture) -- DiffusionGemma in-generation, external-PRM REWARD-GUIDED STEP-STITCHING, must-beat the self-reward SMC intrinsic baseline. .398 (exp4304) had a CLEAN harness (controls_differentiated=true, scorer_leak_recheck_passed=true) and a POSITIVE point estimate (carnot_minus_best_control_delta +0.133) but CI95 [-0.067,0.367] INCLUDED 0 (underpowered, NOT refuted). The .399 sweep flagged the architecture upgrade: instead of a single guided pass, use REWARD-GUIDED STITCHING (arXiv:2602.22871) -- sample DIVERSE diffusion reasoning trajectories, score EVERY intermediate step with the exp4292 external partial-state scorer, and STITCH the highest-scoring steps into a composite (+23.8% in the paper). CRITICAL must-beat baseline (arXiv:2602.01849, the .399 sweep): SELF-REWARD SMC -- a particle filter using the model's OWN trajectory self-confidence (NO external scorer) -- so the moat now means Carnot's EXTERNAL verifier beats the model's INTRINSIC self-confidence -- the sharpest oracle-distinct test in generation. Keep: (1) an INDEPENDENT leak re-check on the exp4292 scorer, (2) >=1 genuinely-engaged non-Carnot control (RFG enhanced!=reference at gamma>0, 2509.25604, OR EntRGi 2602.05000) + the exp4308 DEGENERATE_CONTROLS no-op guard, (3) MORE power (n>=40 per arm). Emit diffusiongemma_guidance_moat BARE bool := (Carnot-stitched - best-engaged-control > 0 AND CI95-excl-0 AND controls_differentiated AND beats self-reward SMC). verifier_is_oracle=false. NO TRM training; NO leaderboard submission; DiffusionGemma via the llama.cpp PR binary. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: diffusiongemma_step_stitching_moat_won; results/experiment_4315_diffusiongemma_reward_guided_stitching.json
+- 2026-06-17: PHASE C1 (DEPLOY the hardened efficiency verifier as a budget-aware CASCADE ROUTER; the .399 SOTA-ingestion headline; broaden the exp4303 win) -- .398 (exp4303) HARDENED the efficiency-parity win (energy 0.8 vs well-prompted judge 0.5, cost_ratio 1.03e-08, CI95 [0.1,0.5] excl 0) but at n>=30 on cross-family ARC selection only. Convert the PROVEN result into a DEPLOYED budget-aware CASCADE policy (arXiv:2510.14913): score every candidate with the cheap discriminative energy verifier first, and escalate ONLY the low-margin (uncertain) cases to the LLM judge -- the operating point that buys most of the judge's accuracy at most of the energy verifier's cost. Compare the CASCADE against always-energy (cheap, lower accuracy) and always-judge (expensive, higher accuracy) controls on a LARGER, multi-corpus n (broaden beyond the exp4303 n>=30: add a 2nd selection corpus -- ARC-GEN generators and/or FoVer-step). Peers to cite: Weaver 2506.18203 (weak-verifier ensemble distilled to 400M rivals o3-mini), MSV 2603.03417 (set-conditioned verifier). Emit cascade_dominates_controls BARE bool := (cascade accuracy >= always-judge accuracy within CI AND cascade cost strictly between always-energy and always-judge AND cascade is Pareto-non-dominated). verifier_is_oracle=false. RE-SCOPE to fit the window (synchronous resume-accumulate, checkpoint after every judge escalation, per-task progress prints; a PARTIAL one-corpus n>=40 ACCEPTED). NOT the retired circular efficiency-vs-judge-ON-CODE (known-issues §0) -- this is the oracle-distinct ARC/cross-family selection. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: always_energy_already_dominates_acc_cascade_0.5500_cost_ratio_0.3019632358; results/experiment_4316_efficiency_cascade_router_deploy.json
